{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.0054270554533805138,"c":1,"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.035657516974615167,"x":0.006073065285377789,"w":0.3061290232340495},{"c":1,"x":0.092402464599992531,"y":0.043604651166349817,"w":0.23203285217285158,"h":0.015988371857499684,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"x":0.090349074644918037,"w":0.36139630635579428,"c":1,"h":0.020473177524442887,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.09144542727785443},{"x":0.090349066197702263,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.","c":1,"y":0.12790697676740903,"h":0.017520752065652956,"w":0.69609858194986984},{"x":0.088295693796933486,"w":0.79055440266927079,"c":1,"t":"Saving money for the future is always a very good idea. First of all money is something that is","h":0.018961376989133916,"y":0.15545722716131327},{"w":0.8151950581868489,"h":0.020409720766860762,"c":1,"t":"needed in almost all areas in life. Whether you are young or old you need money to buy everyday","x":0.088295694593667998,"y":0.17581120961914309},{"w":0.33675565083821613,"c":1,"h":0.02040457598930967,"t":"things like food, clothing, ete. living etc.","x":0.088295685761380582,"y":0.19616519159918444},{"w":0.81724848429361963,"h":0.018957089674508043,"y":0.22529069816894343,"t":"young people are usually often full of enthusiasm about tife their future. They are looking forward","x":0.08829567562815982,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.088295694356046867,"y":0.24563953537783978,"w":0.80698150634765609,"h":0.018962234452059135,"t":"to their first job, to meeting new people or to getting to know as much of the world as they can."},{"y":0.26598837258751706,"h":0.018967379229610226,"x":0.090349088364303332,"c":1,"t":"Many tend to live in the present rather than in the future so that they don't always plan ahead.","w":0.79260777791341153},{"t":"When you people get older and settle down they realize that buying a house, starting a family or","x":0.088295687936769979,"w":0.80492813110351547,"h":0.018968236692535556,"y":0.2949852511797737,"c":1},{"t":"caring for your health takes up a good considerable amount of money and everybody who began","y":0.31388839268552693,"x":0.088238540172704341,"h":0.021928446271778257,"c":1,"w":0.80914922078450513},{"y":0.33569321515094119,"w":0.77207392374674488,"h":0.018957947137433151,"c":1,"x":0.088295686946206903,"t":"saving money in younger years is glad to have done so. However, saving money is not always"},{"w":0.79671457926432299,"x":0.090349075751022662,"t":"possible when you are young. Sometimes unforeseen expenses cannot be avoided, life situations","y":0.35604719713973121,"h":0.018952802359881948,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.088295675830515369,"w":0.82546203613281266,"h":0.018947656457051432,"y":0.37640118025111424,"t":"are suddenly changing or there is never even enough money available even for the most necessary"},{"x":0.088214270502069494,"t":"things. So So how could you save money for the future in this case? In general, you have to ask","y":0.39533836029179836,"c":1,"w":0.80507344563802086,"h":0.022334059993777688},{"x":0.088229534322287584,"y":0.41697783788194043,"h":0.021399274617873054,"w":0.83175109863281249,"c":1,"t":"yourself what your priorities in life are. What are the things you cherish most? Is it more important"},{"h":0.021093326894934594,"x":0.088223430852829382,"t":"for you to plan ahead or do you prefer to just enjoy the moment that you live in?","y":0.43747327674821002,"c":1,"w":0.68185379028320314},{"c":1,"y":0.46656976793604876,"h":0.01897595498414173,"t":"Everybody has to make own choices and to consider what is really essential for him or herself.","x":0.090349088329662944,"w":0.79260777791341153},{"y":0.49557522115748687,"w":0.83162216186523452,"h":0.018959662063283589,"x":0.08624230702883541,"c":1,"t":"In any age taking a moment to f reflect on your life and looking back at the choices you things you"},{"c":1,"x":0.088295687985702448,"y":0.51592920314220425,"t":"have already done is always a good thing to do.","h":0.018954517285732386,"w":0.40657084147135414},{"c":1,"h":0.018932222124397935,"x":0.088295704198690803,"t":"If you know yourself well and all about all the things that really make you happy you will be able to","y":0.54360465147105375,"w":0.82751536051432295},{"y":0.56346351968251873,"h":0.019689466538330813,"w":0.64076944986979167,"c":1,"t":"make the right decisions in financial issues as well as life other areas in life.","x":0.088223103501008163},{"t":"In what way money plays an important role will be easy to be found out then. Perhaps you need less","w":0.83572896321614576,"y":0.59292035400502208,"h":0.018998250145476181,"c":1,"x":0.086242294420869337},{"h":0.021987062077254982,"c":1,"y":0.61210674975366453,"t":"than you first thought years ago.","x":0.087865486896953934,"w":0.27805208841959633},{"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","y":0.64970930252759473,"x":0.090349073023936299,"h":0.014597482034238829,"c":1,"w":0.31211499532063802},{"y":0.67757874200460966,"w":0.75994420369466142,"t":"This is a strong response to the task. In the first paragraph, the candidate makes","x":0.1374679620009592,"h":0.020847568118115056,"c":1},{"w":0.76180699666341145,"y":0.69764011795258174,"x":0.135523606285509,"h":0.016022672625066292,"c":1,"t":"their view clear, agreeing with the statement that saving money for the future is a"},{"t":"good idea. In the next two paragraphs, they present ideas on how saving money is","w":0.78028747558593747,"h":0.017513891799611714,"c":1,"x":0.13552361324116513,"y":0.71504424770657504},{"x":0.13757702399828817,"w":0.77002049763997393,"c":1,"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"actually quite challenging: young people can [tend to live in the present], so [don't","y":0.73244837744668945},{"x":0.13757700054019209,"c":1,"w":0.75564682006835937,"y":0.75132743356064979,"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"a\/ways plan ahead], the cost of housing, starting families and health care can be"},{"t":"high, and [unforeseen expenses cannot be avoided]. The rest of the response is","h":0.016060403244333554,"c":1,"w":0.75564682006835937,"y":0.76889534895230649,"x":0.13552361242783262},{"h":0.017518075025890423,"c":1,"t":"about how people can decide how much to spend and how much to save. The last","x":0.13752400035188117,"y":0.78619315693490244,"w":0.77628158569335948},{"t":"line [Perhaps you need less than you first thought years ago] suggests that saving","y":0.80232567094561946,"w":0.77435114542643213,"x":0.13541277393399517,"h":0.020074118555119536,"c":1},{"t":"is not the answer for everyone. The ending gives advice to the reader, rather than","x":0.13333133257126367,"y":0.81941890460807443,"w":0.77234802246093759,"c":1,"h":0.02137147121373173},{"c":1,"x":0.13552360991323686,"w":0.27515401204427081,"y":0.84011627917701059,"t":"summarising the main ideas.","h":0.015988371857499684},{"t":"134","h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.039014374415079753,"c":1,"x":0.088295687679523768,"y":0.91715116296083044},{"x":0.51176470218665204,"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"h":0.04166666666666663,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666659226195}]}